  "id": "general-arousal",
  "term": "general arousal",
  "definition": "General arousal is a broad increase in alertness or activation that can be set off by a stimulus, such as a frightened face. In this context, it is contrasted with a more specific response to the social meaning of another person’s gaze and emotional expression.",
